 0, 0}, your heart and the Clear\\nBell in harmony have finally made\\fit appear...\\r","msg_0058_D17R0110_00003":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, don’t you see?\\rHO-OH must have been waiting for\\nsomeone like you all this time.\\fWouldn’t you agree...?\\r","msg_0058_D17R0110_00004":"HO-OH: Shaoooh!\\r","msg_0058_D17R0110_00005":"You have done a great job.\\nSay hello to Professor Elm for us.","msg_0058_D17R0110_00006":"You have not only made HO-OH appear,\\nbut you have also caught it...\\rYou are so wonderful.\\nThere is nothing more for us to say.\\rTake good care of yourself in\\nyour journey...","msg_0058_D17R0110_00007":"If that is what you believe, we will not\\ntry to convince you otherwise.\\rStill, if you want to see HO-OH once\\nmore, perhaps you can come back here\\fafter everything has been settled...","msg_0058_D17R0110_00008":"I think when you turn your back to it,\\nHO-OH will not come back for\\fsome time...\\rIf you want to see HO-OH, perhaps you\\ncan come back here after everything\\fhas been settled..."},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{"OnLoad":"_EV_scr_seq_D17R0110_002 + 1","OnTransition":"_EV_scr_seq_D17R0110_003 + 1","OnResume":"_EV_scr_seq_D17R0110_005 + 1"},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_D17R0110_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_D17R0110_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_D17R0110_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_D17R0110_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_D17R0110_004":4,"_EV_scr_seq_D17R0110_005":5,"_EV_scr_seq_D17R0110_006":6,"obj_D17R0110_dancer":0,"obj_D17R0110_dancer_2":1,"obj_D17R0110_dancer_3":2,"obj_D17R0110_dancer_4":3,"obj_D17R0110_dancer_5":4,"obj_D17R0110_hou_obj01":5}}
